# GENERATED_CACHE — model outputs, content-addressed, deliberately in git.
# `services/harness/.generated-cache/README.md` records the decision and the
# reason: the contents are NOT reproducible (re-running the generator produces
# different queries), so these files are frozen experiment inputs. Four of them
# hold a markdown fence the model emitted despite being told not to; that is the
# record of what the model did. `parseStringArray()` in
# `services/harness/src/generated-queries.ts` strips the fence before
# `JSON.parse`, and `readCache()` returns the raw string — so nothing parses
# these as source JSON, and normalising them would edit evidence.
services/harness/.generated-cache/

